461
00:26:44,620 --> 00:26:48,220
Even five minutes a day is very good.

462
00:26:48,220 --> 00:26:50,500
Don't worry about making mistakes.

463
00:26:50,500 --> 00:26:52,220
Mistakes are how we learn.

464
00:26:52,220 --> 00:26:56,220
Be brave and try to speak English when you can.

465
00:26:56,220 --> 00:26:57,600
We believe in you.

